{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ClientProfile\/unknown"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK13ClientProfileO7unknownyA2CmF","roleHeading":"Case","symbolKind":"case","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"unknown","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"ClientProfile.unknown"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"unknown"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/clientprofile\/unknown"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ClientProfile"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"A value this SDK’s copy of the spec does not list; see the type’s summary.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"role":"collection","title":"AxiamSDK","abstract":[{"text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management).","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"},"Self::Standard":{"type":"link","url":"Self::Standard","title":"Standard","identifier":"Self::Standard","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Standard"}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/ClientProfile/unknown":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/clientprofile\/unknown","kind":"symbol","title":"ClientProfile.unknown","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A value this SDK’s copy of the spec does not list; see the type’s summary."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ClientProfile\/unknown","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"unknown"}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/ClientProfile":{"title":"ClientProfile","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ClientProfile","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ClientProfile","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Which security posture a client is registered under (X5.1). This is the FAPI “one switch”.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"FAPI 2.0 is not a single feature but a bundle of constraints — mandatory PAR, mandatory PKCE","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"S256"},{"text":", mandatory strong client authentication, mandatory sender-constrained tokens,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and a refusal of every relaxation the base specs permit. Encoding them as one profile rather"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than a dozen independent booleans means an operator cannot register a client that is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"nearly"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" FAPI, and a reviewer can answer “is this client financial-grade?” by reading one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"field. The same philosophy as the rate-limit postures: ordinary clients see no behaviour"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change at all, because "},{"identifier":"Self::Standard","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is the serde default and every row"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"written before schema v38 decodes to it."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/clientprofile","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ClientProfile","kind":"identifier"}]}}}